{{also|bucherei}}
==German==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|de|Bücher|t1=books|-ei}}; a calque of {{der|de|la|librāria}}, possibly through {{der|de|nl|boekerij}}, which seems to be slightly older.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˌbyːçəˈʁaɪ̯/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Bücherei.ogg|Audio|lang=de}}
* {{rhymes|aɪ̯|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f}}

# [[library]]

====Usage notes====
* The word is typically used only for town libraries or private libraries, while university libraries are generally called ''Bibliothek''.

